{"id":"ocasio_n","lemma":"ocasión","pos":"noun","rank":1585,"glosses":["occasion"],"ipa":"/okaˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ocasiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ocasi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Será una ocasión muy importante.","en":"It'll be a big occasion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587439","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"important"}]},{"text":"En esta ocasión es diferente.","en":"This time it's different.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508934","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"differently"}]},{"text":"Tom solo se pone traje para ocasiones especiales.","en":"Tom only wears a suit on special occasions.","words":[null,{"g":"sole"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"suit"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"special","l":"especial"}]},{"text":"Era una buena ocasión.","en":"It was a good opportunity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512866","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]},{"text":"Vi a los dos juntos en varias ocasiones.","en":"I saw the two together on several occasions.","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"next to","l":"junto"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"various","l":"vario"},null]}]}